  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. The total price of the M&M bags is not provided.\n2. The weights are also contradictory: the bags are said to weigh both 12 ounces and 10 ounces each.\n3. Price per ounce requires  \n   \\[\n   \\text{price per ounce}=\\frac{\\text{total price}}{\\text{total weight}}.\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the price per ounce **cannot be determined from the given information**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "John buys:\n\n\\[\n3 \\times 10 = 30\\text{ ounces}\n\\]\n\nHowever, the total price of the bags is not given. Thus,\n\n\\[\n\\text{price per ounce}=\\frac{\\text{total price}}{30}\n\\]\n\nSo the price per ounce cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined without the total price}}\n\\]",
